Comment: 0,0:01:56.62,0:01:58.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,全神貫注
Comment: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:05.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,保持警惕 直到你看見真實世界
Comment: 0,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.64,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,抓住機會
Comment: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:11.66,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,直到你終結遊戲 答案才會浮現
Comment: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:14.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你必須親自出馬
Comment: 0,0:02:16.25,0:02:17.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是時候覺醒了
Comment: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:23.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,是時候去尋找被隱藏至深的真相
Comment: 0,0:02:23.55,0:02:27.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你準備好倒數計時了嗎
Comment: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:30.30,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,你知道未來無定數
Comment: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:36.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,但我們的選擇至關重要
Comment: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:39.80,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,前路漫漫 未來似乎不堪一擊
Comment: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:47.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,真相也只會讓你窒息
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== OPEN ===
Comment: 1,0:01:56.62,0:01:58.48,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Open up your senses
Comment: 1,0:01:58.48,0:02:05.40,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Keep your guard up 'till you see the real world
Comment: 1,0:02:05.40,0:02:07.64,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Gotta take your chances
Comment: 1,0:02:07.64,0:02:11.66,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You won't find your answers 'till you end the game
Comment: 1,0:02:11.66,0:02:14.62,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,With your own hands
Comment: 1,0:02:16.25,0:02:17.79,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's about time we wake up
Comment: 1,0:02:17.79,0:02:23.55,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Time we start to see the truth hidden beneath
Comment: 1,0:02:23.55,0:02:27.68,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,Are you ready for the countdown
Comment: 1,0:02:27.70,0:02:30.30,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You see the future's never certain
Comment: 1,0:02:30.34,0:02:36.18,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,But it's governed by the choices that we make
Comment: 1,0:02:36.89,0:02:39.80,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,You're standing on a fragile future
Comment: 1,0:02:39.80,0:02:47.28,OPEN,,0,0,0,karaoke,And the truth will take your breath away
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Screen,,0,0,0,,=== END ===
